{"seq":4,"slug":"on-practice","title":"《实践论》精读","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":3,"docCount":8,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/04_on-practice","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践论-精读-简介\">《实践论》精读 简介</h1><p>《实践论》是毛泽东于一九三七年七月在延安抗日军政大学讲授的哲学著作，全称《实践论——论认识和实践的关系，即知和行的关系》。该文以马克思主义认识论为基础，系统阐述了实践在认识过程中的决定性作用，论证了认识从实践中来、又回到实践中去的辩证运动规律，是毛泽东哲学思想的奠基之作。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于希望深入理解马克思主义认识论的读者，无论是哲学研究者、思想政治理论学习者，还是对认识论与方法论问题有探索兴趣的一般读者，都能从本书的精读中获得关于知与行辩证关系的深刻洞见。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>认识论基础与写作背景</strong>，从反对党内主观主义的历史需要出发，阐明毛泽东撰写此文的直接动因，系统论述认识与实践的基本关系，并追溯马克思主义认识论从经验论、唯理论到辩证唯物主义认识论的思想源流。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>认识发展的辩证过程</strong>，深入解析认识运动的两个飞跃——从感性认识到理性认识的第一次飞跃，以及从理性认识回到实践的第二次飞跃，进而阐述认识在实践基础上由低级到高级、由浅入深无限发展的总规律。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>真理观与当代意义</strong>，集中论述实践是检验真理唯一标准这一核心命题的哲学内涵与历史影响，并从《实践论》与《矛盾论》的互文关系中揭示毛泽东哲学思想的体系性特征及其对当代认识论问题的启示。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立认识论的基本框架与历史语境，理解《实践论》的问题意识与理论渊源；再在第二章中详细把握认识运动的辩证过程与内在规律；最后在第三章中将真理观与当代实践联结，并通过与《矛盾论》的对照深化对毛泽东哲学体系的整体理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"epistemology-foundation","title":"认识论基础与写作背景","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/epistemology-foundation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anti-subjectivism-context","title":"写作背景与反对主观主义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/epistemology-foundation/anti-subjectivism-context"},{"seq":2,"slug":"knowledge-practice-relationship","title":"认识与实践的基本关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/epistemology-foundation/knowledge-practice-relationship"},{"seq":3,"slug":"marxist-epistemology-origins","title":"马克思主义认识论源流","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/epistemology-foundation/marxist-epistemology-origins"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"dialectical-cognition-process","title":"认识发展的辩证过程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/dialectical-cognition-process","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"perceptual-to-rational","title":"感性认识到理性认识的飞跃","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/dialectical-cognition-process/perceptual-to-rational"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rational-to-practice","title":"理性认识到实践的飞跃","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/dialectical-cognition-process/rational-to-practice"},{"seq":3,"slug":"general-law-of-cognition","title":"认识运动的总规律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/dialectical-cognition-process/general-law-of-cognition"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"truth-contemporary-significance","title":"真理观与当代意义","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/truth-contemporary-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"practice-tests-truth","title":"实践是检验真理的唯一标准","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/truth-contemporary-significance/practice-tests-truth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intertextuality-with-contradiction","title":"与矛盾论的互文关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-practice/truth-contemporary-significance/intertextuality-with-contradiction"}]}]}